BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:bobcat-trail-races-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
DTSTART:20261017T070000Z
DTEND:20261017T110000Z
SUMMARY:Bobcat Trail Races
DESCRIPTION:Bobcat Trail Races feature one of Colorado Springs' best city parks\, Palmer Park. Runners will enjoy views of the city and Pikes Peak from the rocky bluffs. Multiple distances available (50K\, 25K\, 10K\, 5K) with varying start times and challenges\, from technical single-track to rolling hills and rocky terrain.
LOCATION:Palmer Park\, 3650 Maizeland Rd\, Colorado Springs\, CO 80909
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:blue-sky-marathon-half-marathon-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
DTSTART:20261017T080000Z
DTEND:20261017T120000Z
SUMMARY:Blue Sky Marathon & Half Marathon
DESCRIPTION:Trail running event taking place on trails between Horsetooth Mountain Park and Devil's Backbone Open Space. Marathon on Oct 17 (9-hour cutoff) and Half Marathon on Oct 18 (6-hour cutoff). Course features 100% dirt terrain with 90% singletrack\, elevation gain of 3\,500' (marathon) or 1\,800' (half marathon). Includes aid stations\, finisher awards\, race meal\, and generous cutoff times designed for both veteran and first-time trail runners.
LOCATION:Blue Sky Trailhead\, Horsetooth Mountain Park\, Fort Collins\, Colorado
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:weekend-at-burney-runwalkcrawl-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
DTSTART:20261022T180000Z
DTEND:20261022T220000Z
SUMMARY:Weekend at Burney Run/Walk/Crawl
DESCRIPTION:A laid-back\, high-fun trail adventure featuring a 4.8-mile looped course with 50/50 mix of flowy single-track and dirt service road through beautiful private property near Baum Lake. Multiple race options include 48-hour challenge\, 24-hour challenge\, 12-hour\, and 4.8-mile loop options. Features aid station with snacks\, hot food\, and broth bar. Cash prizes for most miles run. Includes burro race option where participants bring their own donkey.
LOCATION:22800 Guest Ranch Rd\, Cassel\, CA 96016
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
