DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
DTSTART:20261107T080000Z
DTEND:20261107T120000Z
SUMMARY:Colorado 24 Hour Run
DESCRIPTION:A community-focused timed event held on a scenic 1-mile flat dirt loop at the Swift Ponds Campus. Runners can push their limits to see how far they can go in a set amount of time\, with a festive atmosphere and shared meals throughout the day and night.
LOCATION:4927 County Rd 36\, Fort Collins\, CO 80528
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:longmont-turkey-trot-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
DTSTART:20261114T090000Z
DTEND:20261114T130000Z
SUMMARY:Longmont Turkey Trot
DESCRIPTION:The Longmont Turkey Trot features one of the fastest\, most scenic 10K and 2-mile courses in the area. Participants can run\, roll\, or participate in the wheelchair division for the 10K race. Packet pick-up is Friday\, November 13\, 4pm-6pm at the Longmont Recreation Center. Registration closes Thursday\, November 12 at 12pm\, with late registration available November 13 and race morning. Awards given to 1st\, 2nd\, and 3rd place winners in multiple age and gender categories.
LOCATION:Altona Middle School\, 4600 Clover Basin Dr\, Longmont\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
