UID:turkey-trek-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
DTSTART:20261121T083000Z
DTEND:20261121T123000Z
SUMMARY:Turkey Trek
DESCRIPTION:Turkey Trek is a holiday-themed race featuring multiple distances with interactive challenges throughout the course: an Egg Nog Chug Challenge at the 3-mile summit\, a Hay Bale Hop Challenge on the descent\, and a Fill Your Pie Hole Challenge (pumpkin pie) one kilometer from the finish. The course includes an uphill climb to a mesa summit with panoramic views\, a ridge run\, and a gradual descent. Half Marathon finishers receive a commemorative mug. All participants receive a performance blend brown hooded sweatshirt.
LOCATION:Long Lake Regional Park\, Arvada\, CO 80007
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:gobble-wobble-run-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T083000Z
DTEND:20261126T123000Z
SUMMARY:Gobble Wobble Run
DESCRIPTION:Gobble Wobble Run 5K on Thanksgiving Day. Features early packet pickup at Fleet Feet. 2026 beneficiary is the Colorado National Guard Foundation. Title sponsor is The Alan Smith Team at RE/MAX Professionals.
LOCATION:Clement Park\, Littleton\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:broomfield-turkey-day-5k10k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T090000Z
DTEND:20261126T130000Z
SUMMARY:Broomfield Turkey Day 5K/10K
DESCRIPTION:Colorado's Only Thanksgiving Day 10K event welcoming all runners\, walkers\, and families. Participants receive winter knit beanie\, finisher medals (5K/10K)\, free pumpkin pie\, free photos\, chip timing\, and live results. Includes Kids Fun Run. Supports Broomfield FISH food drive charity partner.
LOCATION:13200 Sheridan Blvd\, Broomfield County Commons\, Broomfield\, CO 80020
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:turkey-rock-trot-5k-2026@milehighrunners.com
DTSTAMP:20260927T000000Z
DTSTART:20261126T090000Z
DTEND:20261126T130000Z
SUMMARY:Turkey ROCK Trot 5k
DESCRIPTION:Plum Creek Church 22nd Annual Turkey ROCK Trot presented by CORE. Family-friendly 5K run/walk/stroll on Thanksgiving morning (November 26\, 2026) through downtown Castle Rock. Features live DJ at start line\, live music on course\, indoor health & wellness expo with 30+ vendors\, free kids activities\, and food/beverage options. FREE 1K Kids Dash at 8:30 AM. All proceeds benefit the Help&Hope Center. Early bird pricing: $40 through October 11th.
LOCATION:Douglas County Event Center\, 500 Fairgrounds Drive\, Castle Rock\, CO
STATUS:CONFIRMED
END:VEVENT
